WEBVTT

00:37:27.965 --> 00:37:30.262
And then there will be some children

00:37:30.286 --> 00:37:32.856
where there is no fear
and they're fine for 10 minutes

00:37:32.880 --> 00:37:35.172
but then go off and play by themselves.

00:37:35.196 --> 00:37:37.874
And to talk about it
as if it's no big deal,

00:37:37.898 --> 00:37:39.853
so you're saying to them,

00:37:39.877 --> 00:37:41.750
"Well, yeah, you know,

00:37:41.774 --> 00:37:46.486
I know that you, let's say,
feel uncomfortable on the playground

00:37:46.510 --> 00:37:49.377
having to manage
lots of different social groups.

00:37:49.401 --> 00:37:51.523
Here's what I do
when I'm feeling that way.

00:37:51.547 --> 00:37:55.414
Let's talk about some strategies that you
can use when you're feeling that way."

00:37:55.438 --> 00:37:57.359
CA: And at schools, you'd want teachers

00:37:57.383 --> 00:38:02.961
not to insist on the kind of
hypersocial form of teaching